 and upstream data rates, this PX20+++ module offers a transmission distance of up to 20km over single-mode fiber (SMF) with an SC connector.</p>\n<p>Engineered for seamless integration with EPON OLT equipment, this hot-pluggable SFP module features high sensitivity, low power consumption, and robust temperature stability, making it ideal for telecom networks, ISPs, and enterprise fiber deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Data Rate: 1.25Gbps (symmetrical)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Distance: Up to 20km over single-mode fiber</span></li><li>Connector Type: SC/UPC</li><li>Wavelength: 1490nm (TX) / 1310nm (RX)</li><li>Compatible with EPON OLT equipment</li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">PX20+++ Standard for extended reach and high performance</span></li><li>Hot-Pluggable SFP Form Factor</li><li>Ideal for FTTH, ISP, and Metro Access Networks</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/vsol-gpon-pon-sfp-module-25g-c-9dbm\"